    - target: {fileID: 9001207236097238742, guid: 6067253ee42b3804485503092ce0eaa6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'That night, as I read the war novel, the image of a chessboard came
        to mind.

        I thought maybe I could use this sequence as my own code.

        If
        someone could place the white pieces back in the right order, perhaps only
        those who truly understand the battle could crack the code.'
